{
  "_readme": [
    "Reforging Bench upgrades from one tier to the next. Items are matched by name: <material>_<type>, e.g. iron_pickaxe,",
    "refined_obsidian_helmet. 'chain' maps each material to the materials it upgrades into and what is added at the bench",
    "(an item or a tag, as in recipe JSON). An empty list ends a chain (the material is still recognised as an upgrade target).",
    "'costs' is how many of that material each kind of item takes, matching what crafting it costs; others use 'default_cost'.",
    "Upgrades the smithing table already does (diamond to netherite with the template) are left to it.",
    "Changes take effect on /reload or the next world load. Delete this file to get the defaults back."
  ],
